de dom\u00ednio herdam BaseModel \u2192 PKs UUID e <uuid:pk> em URLs; slugs aleat\u00f3rios via RandomSlugMixin."}, {"id": "readme_cart_session", "label": "Cart por sess\u00e3o (classe Python, sem model)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Carrinho \u00e9 classe Python por sess\u00e3o em apps/checkout \u2014 deliberadamente N\u00c3O \u00e9 um model."}, {"id": "readme_payment_gateway", "label": "PaymentGateway abstrato", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Gateway abstrato com charge/refund/webhook/subscribe/tokenize_credit_card/create_payment_link; providers registrados em _REGISTRY e selecionados por PAYMENT_PROVIDER."}, {"id": "readme_manual_gateway", "label": "ManualGateway (dev)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Em desenvolvimento use PAYMENT_PROVIDER=manual \u2014 nenhuma API real \u00e9 chamada, apenas transa\u00e7\u00f5es marcadas."}, {"id": "readme_asaas_gateway", "label": "AsaasGateway (Pix/cart\u00e3o/boleto)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Suporta Pix (payments-pix-confirm), cart\u00e3o por tokenize_credit_card, boleto (bankSlip em raw_payload), Checkout hosted (create_checkout) e link avulso (create_payment_link) com reconcilia\u00e7\u00e3o por webhook."}, {"id": "readme_asaas_checkout_hosted", "label": "Asaas Checkout hosted", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "POST /checkouts redireciona para a p\u00e1gina do Asaas \u2014 fluxo padr\u00e3o com provider asaas (loja, or\u00e7amento e assinatura); confirmado por webhook CHECKOUT_PAID/CHECKOUT_EXPIRED."}, {"id": "readme_webhook", "label": "Webhook de pagamento (valida token)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Mapeia eventos como PAYMENT_CONFIRMED \u2192 pago; signal aprova a refer\u00eancia/credita comiss\u00e3o. Em produ\u00e7\u00e3o valida x-webhook-token."}, {"id": "readme_services_flow", "label": "Fluxo de servi\u00e7os (or\u00e7amento)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Prestador self-service \u2192 cliente escolhe um prestador \u2192 or\u00e7amento final_price \u2192 aprova\u00e7\u00e3o cria Order(kind=SERVICE)+OrderItem e cobra; webhook + signal complete_service_request_on_paid marca approved."}, {"id": "readme_maintenance_subscription_flow", "label": "Fluxo de assinatura de manuten\u00e7\u00e3o", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Cliente assina em services-plan-subscribe \u2192 Order(kind=SUBSCRIPTION); Checkout hosted RECURRENT (subscription.cycle pelo plan_type) ou subscribe_plan PIX; signal schedule_first_maintenance_visit agenda a 1\u00aa visita e avan\u00e7a next_due_date."}, {"id": "readme_affiliate_flow", "label": "Fluxo de afiliados", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "?ref=CODE \u2192 cookie 30 dias (AffiliateReferralMiddleware) \u2192 Referral no checkout \u2192 pagamento aprovado credita AffiliateProfile.balance (approve_referral); Pix key obrigat\u00f3ria para saque (PayoutRequest)."}, {"id": "readme_transaction", "label": "Transaction (provider, external_id, raw_payload)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "readme_vercel_deploy", "label": "Deploy Vercel (serverless)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Python 3.12 (.python-version), wsgi entrypoint, config.settings.vercel via DJANGO_SETTINGS_MODULE, build.py roda migrate+bootstrap_social, cron /pagamentos/reconciliar com CRON_SECRET."}, {"id": "readme_supabase_session_mode", "label": "Supabase Postgres (session mode 5432)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Session mode (porta 5432) necess\u00e1rio para migrate e prepared statements no build da Vercel; transaction mode (6543) s\u00f3 p/ high-scale; DISABLE_SERVER_SIDE_CURSORS for\u00e7ado em base.py."}, {"id": "readme_media_links", "label": "Media = imagens por URL (sem upload)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "N\u00e3o h\u00e1 upload: imagens s\u00e3o URLField com validate_image_url \u2014 sem bucket, sem django-storages; SERVE_MEDIA=False na Vercel (filesystem ef\u00eamero)."}, {"id": "readme_testing", "label": "Testes e qualidade (SQLite em mem\u00f3ria, coverage \u226570%)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "config.settings.test for\u00e7a SQLite em mem\u00f3ria (offline, n\u00e3o toca banco de dev); comandos espelham o CI; helpers compartilhados em a